#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:743
msgid "Check `node -v` and `git -v` in a terminal; set `user.name` and `user.email`."
msgstr "Проверете `node -v` и `git -v` в терминал; задайте `user.name` и `user.email`."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:744
msgid "Create `JS_Basics_Course/playground/`, open it in VSCode, create `hello.js` with two `console.log` lines, and run it with `node hello.js`."
msgstr "Създайте `JS_Basics_Course/playground/`, отворете я във VSCode, създайте `hello.js` с два реда `console.log` и я изпълнете с `node hello.js`."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:746
msgid "Make it a repository: `git init`, `git add .`, `git commit -m \"Add hello.js\"`. Look at `git status` and `git log --oneline` before and after."
msgstr "Направете я repository: `git init`, `git add .`, `git commit -m \"Add hello.js\"`. Погледнете `git status` и `git log --oneline` преди и след това."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:748
msgid "Create an empty repository on GitHub, connect it with `git remote add origin ...`, and `git push -u origin main`. Refresh the page on GitHub."
msgstr "Създайте празно repository в GitHub, свържете го с `git remote add origin ...` и направете `git push -u origin main`. Презаредете страницата в GitHub."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:750
msgid "Change `hello.js`, commit, push again - once with commands, once with the Source Control view of VSCode."
